# Feature: DST weeks. In Europe/Berlin, "spring" runs across the spring change (2026-03-29, a 167-hour week) and "autumn" across the autumn change (2026-10-25, a 25-hour day). Weekly buckets must follow the local week, and the day bucket of the changed day must hold its real hours.
# Binding: ada's 12-day effort starts Monday 2026-03-23 and crosses 03-29; bo's 10-day effort starts Monday 2026-10-19 and crosses 10-25. Both are leaves, so every booked slot falls in one of the two weeks.
# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
project dstweeks "DST weeks" 2026-03-23 - 2026-11-06 {
  timezone "Europe/Berlin"
}

resource ada "Ada"
resource bo "Bo"

task spring "Spring work" {
  start 2026-03-23-09:00
  effort 12d
  allocate ada
}

task autumn "Autumn work" {
  start 2026-10-19-09:00
  effort 10d
  allocate bo
}
